        "text": "In 2011 the Environmental Protection Agency (EPA) proposed a rule governing \u201ccooling water intake structures\u201d used by industrial facilities."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Sierra Club",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0de8cbea5e6309e6dec8901a674799104713d2fb70e0059593b1be60fd74f7df",
            "evidence_ids": [
