              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioners (United States Fish and Wildlife Service), according to Petitioners (United States Fish and Wildlife Service), the Services argue that the December 2013 draft biological opinions are privileged, predecisional, and deliberative material because they were written by agency staff as recommendations to decision\u2011makers."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Petitioners",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "c15656ca357998e9232b0fc2c6fe94d84e70b8eaff2f28f962d302e2dfb6e44c",
