              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 68,
                "start": 68
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioners, the petitioners propose a bright\u2011line rule: until a biological opinion is formally signed and issued, there is no final decision in an inter\u2011agency consultation."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "Petitioners (United States Fish and Wildlife Service)",
      "status": "complete",
      "summary": null,
